Copyright 2026 Sergei Iakhnitskii and saitenka contributors

libasslite is a runtime-loaded binding and does not bundle libass or its
transitive dependencies.

Third-party components used by the package:

- libass (https://github.com/libass/libass) — ISC license. Loaded from the
  user's system at runtime; not included in libasslite wheels or sdists.
- libloading (https://github.com/nagisa/rust_libloading) — ISC license.
- pyo3 (https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3) — Apache-2.0 OR MIT license.

Their complete copyright and permission notices ship in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.
